TARGET: lib/yarn-lock.js
REASON: The concise arrow body returns the Map from Map#set into forEach, which
discards it, and trips lint/suspicious/useIterableCallbackReturn.  Bracing the
body makes the callback return undefined explicitly.

---
SEARCH:
        specs.forEach((spec) => this.entries.set(spec, this.current));
REPLACE:
        specs.forEach((spec) => {
          this.entries.set(spec, this.current);
        });
